 <h3><u>eid aayi hai rajab shaban ki</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>salle ala ka shor utha<br> zehra ke gharaane ki ye khushiyaan hain<br> mubaarak eid mubaarak<br> eid aayi hai rajab shaabaan ki<br> tin pisar hain haidar ke<br> tinon rajab me aaye hain<br> aamade baaqir huwi pehli rajab ko marhaba<br> paanchwi aayi rajab aaye naqi salle ala<br> daswi rajab ko aaye taqi kehte hain jinhe<br> farzande raza<br> ye tajalli hai dile imraan ki<br> no rajab ko aaye hain<br> asghar ibne shaahe hoda<br> aa gaya zehra ke gulshan me gule umme rabab<br> tisre baabul hawaaej ka mila jis ko khitaab<br> arsh pe qudsi jhoom rahe hain aur zameen pe<br> buturaab<br> jaan hain ye sayyade zishaan ki<br> tera rajab ko aaye ali<br> tera rajab ko aaye ali<br> wo jahaan me aa gaya jo ho gaya ghaalib laqab<br> aamade binte asad par shak huwi diwaar jab<br> khush huwa kaaba aur payambar bole abu talib<br> ke lab<br> ye pisar tasweer hai subhaan ki<br> bibi zainab ki wilaadat<br> hai pehli shaabaan ko<br> shabbar o shabbir jaise bhayi ki hamshir hai<br> malka e sharm o haya hai waarise tatheer hai<br> shaan me zehra baat me haidar azm me ye<br> shabbir hai<br> pehli aayat sabr ke quraan ki<br> shaabaan ki hai tisri<br> aur aamad shabbir ki<br> raahib o fitrus pukaare aa gaya mera sakhi<br> arsh se jhula jhulaane aa gaye jibreel bhi<br> raaqibe doshe ehmade mursal fakhre khuda aur<br> fakhre ali<br> ye khabar hai tisri shaabaan ki<br> chothi sahar shaabaan ki<br> aur aamad abbas ki<br> god me le kar ali bole mera akkaas hai<br> ye dile zainab dile shabbir ka ehsaas hai<br> maine dua me maanga tha jisko han ye wohi<br> abbas hai<br> hai sanad allah ke ehsaan ki<br> aayi thi shaabaan ki saat<br> ibne hasan qaasim ke saath<br> jab liya aaghosh me farwa pukaari ay khuda<br> hubahu hai baap ki surat ye mera laadla<br> meri ibaadat meri riyaazat ka ye diya hai tu ne<br> sila<br> laaj rakhli tu ne mere maan ki<br> gyaara thi shaabaan ki<br> thi wilaadat akbar ki<br> dekh kar is chaand ko wo chaand bhi sharmaa<br> gaya<br> umme layla ne kaha lo aa gaye phir mustafa<br> is ke husn ka khums nikaala tab yusuf ko husn<br> mila<br> maang le kheir zuleikha jism o jaan ki<br> mehdiye doraan ki aamad<br> hai pandra shaabaan ko<br> ay khusha qismat zameen par aa gaya wo<br> maahtaab<br> wo ujaala din ka hai jaanashine buturaab<br> mazhare yazdaan ka wo mazhar noore mujassam<br> laajawaab<br> laaj rakhne aa gaya yazdaan ki<br> ehlebeyt ki khushiyon me<br> saare hussaini shaamil hain<br> ek duje se gale mil kar mubaarak baad do<br> pehn ke kapre naye ghar ghar charaagha bhi<br> karo<br> saare hussaini mazhar aur farhaan ki tarha mil<br> ke kaho<br> eid aayi hai rajab shaabaan ki</p> 
